  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_01",
      "hash64": "4A602E61B3DEF66A",
      "text": "Tiens, ça t’intéresserait que je compare la taille\\nd’un de tes Pokémon aux autres spécimens\\r\\nde son espèce ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_02",
      "hash64": "4A602D61B3DEF4B7",
      "text": "D’accord ! Quel Pokémon veux-tu me montrer ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_03",
      "hash64": "4A602C61B3DEF304",
      "text": "Alors, voyons où se situe [VAR 0x0102(0001)]...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0102",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_04",
      "hash64": "4A602B61B3DEF151",
      "text": "Ça alors ! Il est vraiment gigantesque !!!\\c\\nCrois-moi, c’est exceptionnel de voir\\nun spécimen aussi grand !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_05",
      "hash64": "4A602A61B3DEEF9E",
      "text": "Ça m’étonnerait pas que ce soit le plus grand\\n[VAR 0x0101(0001)] du monde !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_06",
      "hash64": "4A602961B3DEEDEB",
      "text": "Eh bien ! En voilà, un beau gabarit !\\c\\nÇa doit être rassurant d’avoir un compagnon\\naussi robuste à ses côtés !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_07",
      "hash64": "4A602861B3DEEC38",
      "text": "Hé hé, on dirait qu’il est un peu plus grand que\\nla moyenne !\\r\\nIl est remarquable, alors prends bien soin de lui !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_08",
      "hash64": "4A602761B3DEEA85",
      "text": "Apparemment, il est à peine plus grand\\nque la moyenne !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_09",
      "hash64": "4A602661B3DEE8D2",
      "text": "Il est parfaitement dans la norme ! Mais ça a aussi\\nson charme, d’être comme tout le monde !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_10",
      "hash64": "4A5CA961B3DBDE94",
      "text": "Apparemment, il est à peine plus petit\\nque la moyenne !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_11",
      "hash64": "4A5CAA61B3DBE047",
      "text": "Hé hé, on dirait qu’il est un peu plus petit que\\nla moyenne !\\r\\nIl est remarquable, alors prends bien soin de lui !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_12",
      "hash64": "4A5CAB61B3DBE1FA",
      "text": "Eh bien ! En voilà, un petit format !\\c\\nJe trouve ça trognon, moi. D’ailleurs, je suis sûre\\nqu’il est célèbre parmi les [VAR 0x0101(0001)].",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_13",
      "hash64": "4A5CAC61B3DBE3AD",
      "text": "Ça alors ! Il est vraiment minuscule !!!\\c\\nCrois-moi, c’est exceptionnel de voir\\nun spécimen aussi petit !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_14",
      "hash64": "4A5CA561B3DBD7C8",
      "text": "Ça m’étonnerait pas que ce soit le plus petit\\n[VAR 0x0101(0001)] du monde !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_15",
      "hash64": "4A5CA661B3DBD97B",
      "text": "Merci de me l’avoir montré ! C’est un honneur\\nde pouvoir observer un Pokémon si grand !\\c\\nIl a bien mérité de recevoir cet insigne !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_16",
      "hash64": "4A5CA761B3DBDB2E",
      "text": "Merci de me l’avoir montré ! C’est un honneur\\nde pouvoir observer un Pokémon si petit !\\c\\nIl a bien mérité de recevoir cet insigne !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
